<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>OAuth Not Configured - OctoStore</title>
    <base href="/" />

    <meta name="description" content="OAuth configuration required">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://early.webawesome.com/webawesome@3.0.0-beta.3/dist/styles/webawesome.css" />
    <script type="module" src="https://early.webawesome.com/webawesome@3.0.0-beta.3/dist/webawesome.loader.js"></script>
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: var(--wa-font-sans);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f8ff 0%, #e6f3ff 25%, #ddeeff 50%, #d4e9ff 75%, #cce4ff 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--wa-color-neutral-900);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .alert {
            background: var(--wa-color-warning-50);
            border: 2px solid var(--wa-color-warning-200);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .alert-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--wa-color-warning-600);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .alert-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--wa-color-warning-800);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .alert-message {
            color: var(--wa-color-warning-700);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        code {
            background: var(--wa-color-neutral-100);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
        }
        
        .back-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--wa-color-primary-600);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        
        .back-btn:hover {
            background: var(--wa-color-primary-700);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="alert">
            <div class="alert-icon">⚙️</div>
            <h2 class="alert-title">OAuth Configuration Required</h2>
            <div class="alert-message">
                <p>GitHub OAuth authentication is not configured for this instance of OctoStore.</p>
                <p>To enable authentication, the administrator needs to:</p>
                <ol style="text-align: left; margin: 1rem 0;">
                    <li>Create a GitHub OAuth App</li>
                    <li>Set the <code>AppSettings:GitHubClientId</code> configuration</li>
                    <li>Set the <code>AppSettings:GitHubClientSecret</code> configuration</li>
                </ol>
                <p>Please contact the system administrator to enable authentication.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/" class="back-btn">
            <wa-icon name="arrow-left"></wa-icon>
            Back to Home
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>